{"id":"n24503-1-8","stage":2,"title":"구석 · 角","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24503-1-8-1","ko":"쓰레기통은 어디에 둘까?","zh":"垃圾桶应该放在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쓰레기통은","meaning":"垃圾桶，垃圾箱","explanation":"쓰레기통：垃圾桶，垃圾箱；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"쓰레기통","audio":"/audio/bba8bd7c92972ab25f79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65174","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰레기통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘까?","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bba8bd7c92972ab2","term":"쓰레기통","zh":"垃圾桶，垃圾箱","audio":"/audio/bba8bd7c92972ab25f79.mp3","entryId":"65174","definition":"装盛或聚集垃圾的桶。","pronunciation":["쓰레기통"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9ac11507e6ff29d439b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24503-1-8-2","ko":"책상 밑 구석에 두는 게 좋겠어.","zh":"放在书桌下面的角落里比较好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밑","meaning":"下面，底下","explanation":"밑：下面，底下","readings":[{"term":"밑","audio":"/audio/37845b61ce7b1c96917e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"